{
  "title": "Contact Us | A B KHAN & ASSOCIATES - Chartered Accountants",
  "description": "Contact A B KHAN & ASSOCIATES in Nerul, Navi Mumbai for Accounting, Taxation, Audit, GST and Business Registration services.",
  "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:var(--gold-light)\">Get In Touch</p>\n    <h1>Let's Talk About Your Accounting & Compliance Needs</h1>\n    <p>Whether it's a quick question or a full engagement, our team typically responds within one business day.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n      <a href=\"tel:+918286681960\" class=\"btn btn-gold btn-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg> Call Us</a>\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/918286681960\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"/></svg> WhatsApp Us</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"container contact-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Contact Details</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;\">Reach Us Directly</h2>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><div><h4>Office Address</h4><p>A Wing 401, Nerul Aakash Ganga CHS, Plot No. B-71, Seawoods East, Sector 23, Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra 400706</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg></div><div><h4>Phone</h4><p><a href=\"tel:+918286681960\">+91 8286681960</a></p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-10 6L2 7\"/></svg></div><div><h4>Email</h4><p><a href=\"mailto:abkhanassociates@gmail.com\">abkhanassociates@gmail.com</a></p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div><div><h4>Business Hours</h4><p>Mon – Sat: 10:00 AM – 07:00 PM</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"/></svg></div><div><h4>WhatsApp</h4><p><a href=\"https://wa.me/918286681960\">Chat with us instantly</a></p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-social\">\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z\"/></svg></a>\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\"/><path d=\"M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z\"/><line x1=\"17.5\" y1=\"6.5\" x2=\"17.51\" y2=\"6.5\"/></svg></a>\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"9\" width=\"4\" height=\"12\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/></svg></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"map-embed\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Seawoods%20East%20Sector%2023%20Navi%20Mumbai&t=&z=14&output=embed\"></iframe></div>\n    </div>\n    <form novalidate data-demo-form class=\"contact-form\">\n      <h3 class=\"contact-form__title\">Send Us a Message</h3>\n      <p class=\"contact-form__sub\">Fill in the details and our team will get back to you.</p>\n      <div class=\"form-row\">\n        <div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"ct-name\">Name *</label><input id=\"ct-name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your full name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required></div>\n        <div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"ct-phone\">Phone Number *</label><input id=\"ct-phone\" name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"10-digit mobile number\" autocomplete=\"tel\" required></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"form-group full\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><label for=\"ct-email\">Email Address *</label><input id=\"ct-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required></div>\n      <div class=\"form-group full\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><label for=\"ct-service\">Service Required</label>\n        <select id=\"ct-service\" name=\"service\"><option>General Enquiry</option><option>Accounting</option><option>Taxation</option><option>GST</option><option>Audit</option><option>Business Registration</option><option>Billing Software</option></select>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"form-group full\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><label for=\"ct-msg\">Message *</label><textarea id=\"ct-msg\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell us how we can help\" required></textarea></div>\n      <label class=\"contact-form__consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ct-consent\" name=\"consent\" required> I consent to being contacted regarding my enquiry.</label>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-navy contact-form__submit\">Send Message</button>\n      <p class=\"form-note\">We typically respond within one business day.</p>\n      <div class=\"form-success\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"/></svg> Thank you! We've received your message and will respond shortly.</div>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--off-white);padding-top:0\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"cta-banner\">\n      <div><h3>Prefer to talk it through?</h3><p>Book a free consultation slot and we'll call you at a time that works.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"btn btn-gold\">Book Consultation</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"contact-faq\">\n  <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width:820px\">\n    <div class=\"section-head center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center\">FAQ</p><h2>Before You Reach Out</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\">How quickly will I hear back? <span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>We aim to respond to all enquiries within one business day, often sooner during business hours.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\">Do I need to visit the office in person? <span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>No — most consultations and ongoing work are handled over phone, email, WhatsApp and our Client Portal.</p></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
}
